                                                "sense_id": "de03d3f9-c6aa-3206-b64c-497415355ec3",
                                                "text": "Harper's Magazine\nThe swing, the gait, the pose, the allure of these men."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fc7b2221-5204-37d8-8ae4-a6be2b862489",
